		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">iMX+OF shunt trip release with auxiliary contact, Acti9, 220-415 V AC</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Acti9 iMX+OF shunt trip release with an open/close auxiliary contact (OF), control voltage 220-415 V AC, for iC60, iID, iC40 and iSW-NA (public product page). Coil terminals C1-C2 and OF terminals 11, 12, 14 ASSUMED.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
